    "A fresh start clears every photo, drawing and voice memo, the status history and read receipts — from both iPhones and from iCloud. Your link, both current statuses, the heart and your date stay. It needs you both: one asks, the other agrees, and nothing is cleared before that. Anything still waiting to send goes afterwards." : {

